Just ran into this issue myself while playing around with Godot 4.0 stable. Small sample code to demonstrate:

```gdscript
var stats = {
	health = 100
}

var actions = {
	hit = func(damage := 1):
		stats.health -= damage
		if (stats.health <= 0):
			actions.die()
,	die = func():
		queue_free()
}
```
This currently errors on `actions.die()` with `Could not resolve member "actions": Cyclic reference.`
